expected_issues.description:
`ensureLeadingAndTrailingSlash` doesn’t handle empty string; `result.charAt(0)` and `result.charAt(result.length - 1)` will be `''`, producing `//`. If `scopePath`/`currentPath` can ever be empty (e.g., root), guard it explicitly to avoid generating malformed rules.

```suggestion
  let result = dirPath.replace(/\\/g, '/');
  if (!result) return '/';
  if (!result.startsWith('/')) result = '/' + result;
  if (!result.endsWith('/')) result = result + '/';
```

